// Description :
"P4244998494" "Steal information from the Destroyer leader"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3069985830" "You took down Big Bad Man and found a torn apart dossier."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1670575499" "You've recovered the information that Wardog needed."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3317300286" "Hrm... well, this is all interesting information, but I don't see how this pertains to anything we're working on. Unless Wardog is planning on somehow controlling the Hamidon to destroy Cole. But that would be idiotic.<br><br>Whatever, I'll get him this information. For now, however, you and I have bigger problems. <i>Mother</i>."
// RandomFameString :
"P3958075051" "string"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Beholder 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P2415128485" "Beholder has told me your mission. Please be quick, I can only sustain this link for a short amount of time."
// Answer Text :
"P671078168" "Will do. (StartMission)"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P345235635" "I was foolish to think it would all be this simple. When is it ever simple, {HeroName}? Mother planned for this all along. I suppose this is what Vanessa did when she first found me.<br><br>I was able to break all the other girls off of the network. All except one. Mother has placed an aspect of herself within one seer's mind. I tried to dive into the woman's mind to clear it, but I nearly was taken back into the network in the process. I'd rather die on the spot today than go back to that 'place', {HeroName}."
// AcceptString :
"P1823549573" "So am I supposed to mind dive into this woman?"
// SendOffString :
"P2805004536" "Yes, that's exactly what you need to do. Give me a few moments to prepare myself. I'll focus my efforts to shield one of our Seers on the topside. She'll send you into the girl's mind. There, you will have to do battle with the aspect of Mother. <color orange>You'll have to be prepared, {HeroName}. Mother ensures that her protections on her girls are extremely powerful.</color><br><br>In the meantime, I will prepare the other girls for our first test run of the psychic bombs."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1122192833" "Defeat the Aspect of Praetor Tilman"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4118524128" "What are you waiting for?"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P4126107276" "<color deepskyblue>Part Three: Always Remember Mother</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1621324834" "You find yourself within the pulsing mind of one of the Seers. Echoes of voices can be heard. Up ahead you see...other seers? These must be some sort of defensive procedures installed in this woman's mind."
// ExitStringSuccess :
"P138158980" "When the Aspect of Tilman is defeated, you're flung back into your body."

