// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1379102139" "You've freed the mind of the final seer!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3234489206" "You did what I could not, {HeroName}. Part of me is jealous, the other, angry. I know now that I'll never get the chance to hand Tilman her head. No, by the time we get far enough to storm the gates of her 'hospital', I will be long dead. I suppose I can take solace in the fact that I helped you achieve this.<br><br>Our plans are almost ready, at the very least. Today, the PPD will know our pain, our power, and our ability to destroy what they hold dear."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3850214574" "It's done, {HeroName}. It's all done.<br><br>The seers have unleashed their bombs onto one of the offices in Imperial City. It was a glorious slaughter. Every living being in there is now <i>dead</i>. The seers did their job wonderfully. All that's left is to retrieve the proper information in that office. I would go myself, but I believe my time on this plane is coming to an end. I can feel it getting harder to breathe. I may have a few more weeks, if I can keep myself from doing any heavy activity. I'd like to ask that you go into that office and retrieve the information that was stored in there. It's a boring request, but at least you're not dying, right?"
// AcceptString :
"P1312816809" "...right."
// SendOffString :
"P1677507827" "Good. It might be a bit of a scene when you walk in there. The PPD haven't gone in yet for a clean up; I'm fairly certain they don't even know what has happened. This is the perfect chance to get in there and get whatever information is supposed to be stored in that building. I'd say good luck, but there's no reason to."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2620790626" "Retrieve Information from the Psychic Slaughter"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P676283171" "Can't talk... having a slight asthma attack..."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P4092968485" "<color deepskyblue>Part Four: Devastation</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3648014389" "The office looks as if nothing at all has happened. But you can see the motionless bodies of PPD up ahead."

