// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3603780033" "You found information about an entrance into the Behavioral Adjustment Facility and fought off Clockwork who seemed to be looking for a girl named Penelope."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P399702097" "Ah, the plans for the BAF. I should have known this is what Wardog was after. Vagabond has been talking constantly about rescuing all the men that were sent there. Did you enjoy the carnage that you saw down there, {HeroName}? I wish I could've seen it myself.<br><br>You were assaulted by Clockwork who weren't speaking in code? That's... odd. I know I felt an odd psychic presence when you were there. There are rumors floating around about some sort of Clockwork 'saint', though that's silly, of course. I wouldn't let it bother you; I know I'm not. I have little time left on this world of ours, I intend to use it by looking into the minds of those we're about to destroy utterly. At least then I'll get some form of entertainment before I die."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
